== gen-certs ==
gen-certs: writing dev mTLS material to secrets/dev/certs
gen-certs: done. CA + control/worker/sink/harness-client leaves in secrets/dev/certs (ca.key stays here, gitignored).
gen-certs: keys are 600 and owned by YOU; run tools/own-secrets.sh (dev.sh certs does) to hand control.key/worker.key to their container uids.
== gen-secrets ==
gen-secrets: wrote dev KMS master key -> secrets/dev/kms/dev-master.key (Control-only; admin Encrypt-only)
gen-secrets: operator admin (Domain B) key is minted (bcrypt) by 'provision-worker admin-key'
             and written to .env by 'scripts/dev.sh certs' (ADMIN_API_KEY / ADMIN_API_KEY_HASHES).
gen-secrets: done.
== provision dev worker + operator admin key + write .env ==
.env written (gitignored). TWO worker tokens/hashes + operator admin key + platform service token provisioned.
== own-secrets ==
own-secrets: chown'd control.key + dev-master.key -> uid 10001, worker.key -> uid 10002 (mode 600 kept)
own-secrets: ok — Control(uid 10001) reads control.key+dev-master.key, worker(uid 10002) reads worker.key, keys are 600, and no other uid can read them
